# Project Chimera: Autonomous AI Influencer System

## Overview
Project Chimera is an autonomous AI influencer system that researches trends, generates content, and manages engagement across multiple social media platforms without human intervention.

## Core Philosophy
We practice **Spec-Driven Development (SDD)**. No implementation code is written until specifications are complete and ratified.
